<title>USA: Fed added reserves via overnight system repo's.</title>
<headline>Fed added reserves via overnight system repo's.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve added temporary reserves to the banking system on Thursday through overnight system repurchase operations, a Fed spokeswoman confirmed.</p>
<p>Fed funds were trading at 5-9/16 percent at the time of the operation, above the Fed's 5-1/2 percent target for the rate.</p>
<p>(( -- North American Treasury Desk 212-859-1679))</p>
